statement:
Let $n$ be a natural number and let $S \subseteq [n]$. Summing the Walsh--Fourier character $\chi_S$ over the entire Boolean hypercube $\{0,1\}^n$ gives
\[
  \sum_{x \in \{0,1\}^n} \chi_S(x) \;=\;
  \begin{cases} 2^n & \text{if } S = \varnothing,\\ 0 & \text{if } S \ne \varnothing. \end{cases}
\]

replaced:
